  "description": "The core of Broadside, a fully managed .NET implementation of ISO 32000-2: the COS object layer, the document model, stream filters, font program parsers, image codecs, the content interpreter, the display list and backend contract, text extraction, the layout tree, logical structure, forms, annotations, security handlers, signatures, canvas writing, diagnostics and dependency-injection registration. No native dependencies.",
